# The core library has NO runtime dependencies and needs NO keys.
# Only the demo app (demo/) calls a model.
#
# To run the demo:  cp .env.example .env  →  add your key  →  npm run demo
#
# The demo runs a REAL Claude agent over the Anthropic Messages API. The key is
# read server-side only and never reaches the browser. Use your own key; the
# default model is cheap and the loop is capped per message.

ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Optional — any model your key can call. Default: claude-haiku-5-5 (cheapest).
# ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-haiku-5-5

# Optional — the port the demo serves on. Default: 5173.
# PORT=5173
